    "text": "X KAL DECEMBR: PASSIO SANCTAE CECILIE VIRGINIS.\nIU ON EALDUM DAGUM W\u00e6S SUM \u00e6\u00f0ELE M\u00e6DEN Cecilia gehaten, fram cildhade cristen, on\n\u00deeos halige f\u00e6mne h\u00e6fde on hire breoste swa micele lufe to \u00feam ecan life \u00fe\u00e6t heo d\u00e6ges and nihtes\nHeo wear\u00f0 swa\u00feeah beweddad swa swa hit woldon hire frynd, anum \u00e6\u00feelan cnihte, se n\u00e6s cristen \u00fea\nHw\u00e6t \u00f0a Cecilia hi sylfe gescrydde mid h\u00e6ran to lice, and gelome f\u00e6ste biddende mid wope \u00fe\u00e6t heo\nHeo clypode to halgum and to heahenglum biddende heora fultumes to \u00feam heofonlican Gode, \u00fe\u00e6t heo\nHit gewear\u00f0 swa\u00feeah \u00fe\u00e6t se wur\u00f0fulla cniht \u00fea brydlac gefor\u00feode, and gefette \u00fe\u00e6t m\u00e6den mid\n\u00dea betwux \u00feam sangum and \u00feam singalum dreamum sang Cecilia symle \u00feus Gode, Fiat cor meum et\nHi wurdon \u00fea gebrohte on bedde \u00e6tg\u00e6dere, and Cecilia sona, \u00fe\u00e6t snotere m\u00e6den, gespr\u00e6c hire\nEala \u00feu min leofa man ic \u00fee mid lufe secge, Ic h\u00e6bbe godes encgel \u00fee gehylt me on lufe, and gif \u00feu\nGif \u00feu \u00feonne me lufast, and butan la\u00f0e gehylst on cl\u00e6num m\u00e6g\u00f0hade, Crist \u00feonne lufa\u00f0 \u00fee, and his\nSe cniht wear\u00f0 \u00fea afyrht, and cw\u00e6\u00f0 to \u00feam m\u00e6dene, Do \u00fe\u00e6t ic geseo sylf \u00feone engel, gif \u00feu wylt \u00fe\u00e6t\nCecilia \u00fea cw\u00e6\u00f0, gif \u00feu on Crist gelyfst and \u00feu gefullod bist fram fyrnlicum synnum, \u00feu miht sona\nUalerianus andwyrde \u00fea eft \u00feam m\u00e6dene, Hwa mihte me fullian \u00feus f\u00e6rlice nu, \u00fe\u00e6t ic mihte geseon\nSeo f\u00e6mne \u00fea l\u00e6rde swa lange \u00feone cniht o\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t he gelyfde on \u00feone lifigendan God, and ferde to \u00feam\nSe papa \u00fea blissode \u00fe\u00e6t he gebeah to Gode, and b\u00e6d \u00feone \u00e6lmihtigan God \u00fe\u00e6t he for his arf\u00e6stnysse\nEfne \u00fea f\u00e6rlice \u00e6tforan heora gesih\u00feum com Godes engel mid anum gyldenum gewrite, and Ualerianus\n\u00dea ar\u00e6rde hine se engel and het hine r\u00e6dan \u00fea gyldenan stafas \u00fee him God tosende.\nOn \u00feam gewrite w\u00e6ron \u00feas word gelogode, Unus deus, una fides, unum baptisam; An \u00e6lmihtig God is,\n\u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 se engel, gelyfst \u00feu \u00feises, o\u00f0\u00f0e lica\u00f0 \u00fee elles hw\u00e6t?\nUalerianus andwyrde, hw\u00e6t bi\u00f0 \u00e6fre so\u00f0licre o\u00f0\u00f0e to gelyfenne \u00e6nigum lifigendum menn?\nAnd se engel \u00fea gewende mid \u00feam worde him fram.\nSe papa \u00f0a si\u00f0\u00f0an hine sona gefullode, and his geleafan him t\u00e6hte, and let hine eft faran ham to\n\u00dea funde se cniht \u00fea f\u00e6mnan standende on hire gebedum on hire bure ane and Godes engel standande\n\u00dea cynehelmas w\u00e6ron wundorlice scinende on rosan readnysse, and on lilian hwitnysse.\nAnd he forgeaf \u00fea \u00e6nne \u00feam \u00e6\u00feelan m\u00e6dene, and o\u00feerne \u00feam cnihte, and cw\u00e6\u00f0 him \u00feus to, Healda\u00f0\nNe hi n\u00e6fre ne forsearia\u00f0 ne heora swetnysse ne forleosa\u00f0, ne heora wlita ne awent to wyrsan hiwe, ne\n\u00dea cneowode se cniht and cw\u00e6\u00f0 to \u00feam engle, N\u00e6s me nan \u00feing swa leof on \u00feysum life wunigende swa\n\u00deas bene ic bidde \u00fe\u00e6t min bro\u00feor Tiburtius beo alysed \u00feurh God and to geleafan gebiged, and he do\n\u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 se engel eft mid blisse him to, For\u00fean\u00fee \u00feu \u00fe\u00e6s b\u00e6de \u00fee bet Gode lica\u00f0 \u00fein bro\u00f0or Tiburtius\nAnd se engel \u00fea gewende up to heofonum.\nHi smeadon \u00fea mid gl\u00e6dnysse, and embe Godes willan spr\u00e6con, o\u00fe\u00fe\u00e6t his bro\u00feor com bli\u00f0e on\n\u00d0eah \u00fee ic h\u00e6fde me on handa \u00fea blostman, ne mihton hi swa wynsumne wyrtbr\u00e6\u00f0 macian; and ic\n\u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 se bro\u00f0or, \u00feurh mine bene \u00fee com \u00fe\u00e6s wynsuma br\u00e6\u00f0 to \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu wite heonanfor\u00f0 hw\u00e6s blod\nWe habba\u00f0 cynehelmas halige mid us scinende swa swa rose and snawhwite swa swa lilie, \u00fea \u00feu ne\n\u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 tiburtius, Sege me, bro\u00f0or min, gehyre ic \u00feis on sl\u00e6pe, o\u00f0\u00f0e \u00feu hit s\u00e6gst on eornost?\nSe o\u00f0er him cw\u00e6\u00f0 to, o\u00f0 \u00feis we leofodon swilce we on sl\u00e6pe w\u00e6ron, ac we synd nu gewende to\n\u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 se o\u00feer, Hu wear\u00f0 \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6t cu\u00fe?\nUalerianus andwyrde, Godes engel me t\u00e6hte, and \u00feone \u00feu miht geseon gif \u00f0u so\u00f0lice bist on fulluhte\nHi spr\u00e6con \u00fea swa lange, o\u00f0\u00fe\u00e6t he to geleafan beah, and se bro\u00f0or wolde \u00fe\u00e6t he wurde gefullod.\n\u00dea befran Tiburtius hwa hine fullian sceolde.\nSe o\u00f0er him cw\u00e6\u00f0 to, Urbanus se papa.\nEft \u00fea Tiburtius him andwyrde and cw\u00e6\u00f0, Se is geutlagod and li\u00f0 him on digelan for his cristendome,\nAnd \u00fea hwile \u00fee we seca\u00f0, swa swa hit ges\u00e6d is, godcundnysse on heofonum, we graman gemeta\u00f0\n\u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 Cecilia sona mid gebylde, gif \u00feis lif w\u00e6re ana, and o\u00feer n\u00e6re selre, \u00feonne mihte we\n\u00dea axode Tiburtius, is \u00e6nig o\u00feer lif?\nCecilia him cw\u00e6\u00f0 to, Cu\u00f0 is gehwilcum menn \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feis lif is geswincful, and on swate wuna\u00f0; \u00feis lif\n\u00deonne cym\u00f0 him dea\u00f0 to, and de\u00f0 of gemynde ealle \u00fea blysse \u00fee he breac on his life, and on \u00feam ecan\n\u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 Tiburtius, hwa com \u00feanon hider \u00fee mihte us secgan gif hit swa w\u00e6re?\nCecilia \u00fea aras, and mid anr\u00e6dnysse cw\u00e6\u00f0, Ealle gesceafta scyppend \u00e6nne sunu gestrynde, and\n\u00dea andwyrde Tiburtius, \u00e6nne God gebodia\u00f0, and humeta namast \u00feu namcu\u00f0lice \u00fery Godas?\nCecilia him andwyrde, an God is \u00e6lmihtig on his m\u00e6gen\u00ferymnysse wunigende; \u00f0one arwur\u00f0ia\u00f0 we\n\u00dea feoll Tiburtius forht to hire cneowum, and clypode hlude, and cw\u00e6\u00f0 mid geleafan, Ne \u00feinc\u00f0 me\nAc ic axie git be \u00feam o\u00ferum life, hwa \u00fe\u00e6t gesawe, and si\u00f0\u00f0an come hider?\nHw\u00e6t \u00fea Cecilia him snoterlice andwyrde, and s\u00e6de hu se H\u00e6lend of heofonum com to us, and\n\u00dea weop Tiburtius, and gewilnode georne \u00fe\u00e6t he gefullod wurde \u00e6t \u00feam fores\u00e6dan papan, and se\nSe papa \u00f0a Urbanus blissode on Gode, and gefullode sona \u00feone ges\u00e6ligan cniht, and s\u00e6de him\nHe beget \u00fea \u00e6t Gode \u00fea gastlican ges\u00e6l\u00fea, swa \u00fe\u00e6t he d\u00e6ghwamlice Drihtnes englas geseh, and swa\n\u00dea w\u00e6s on Rome byrig sum re\u00f0e cwellere Almachius gehaten, se w\u00e6s heahgerefa, and he mid\nUalerianus \u00fea and his fores\u00e6da bro\u00feor bebyrigdon \u00fea martyras \u00fee se manfulla acwealde, and\nHw\u00e6t \u00fea Almachius het \u00fea men gelangian, and axode hi sona mid swi\u00f0licre \u00fereatunge hwi hi \u00fea\n\u00dea andwyrde Tiburtius \u00feam arleasan and cw\u00e6\u00f0, Eala, gif \u00fea halgan \u00fee \u00feu hete ofslean and we\nHi \u00fea swa lange motodon, o\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t se manfulla het mid saglum beatan \u00feone o\u00feerne bro\u00feor; and sum\nAlmachius \u00fea het his manfullan cwelleras l\u00e6dan \u00fea gebro\u00f0ra on bendum tog\u00e6dere to \u00feam h\u00e6\u00feengilde,\nHi l\u00e6dde \u00fea Maximus swa se manfulla het mid o\u00ferum cwellerum to \u00fe\u00e6re cwealmstowe.\n\u00dee weop Maximus for\u00fean\u00fee hi woldon sweltan, and axode \u00fea gebro\u00f0ra hwi hi swa bli\u00feelice eodon to\n\u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 se yldra bro\u00feor, Noldon we efstan to dea\u00fee mid swa mycelre blisse, gif we to beteran life\nBetwux \u00fe\u00e6re tihtinge \u00fea \u00fea hi tengdon for\u00f0, \u00fea cw\u00e6\u00f0 se Maximus to \u00feam martyrum \u00feus, Ic wolde eac\n\u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 se gingra bro\u00f0or of \u00feam bendum him to, Ure drihten Crist de\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu gesihst, \u00feonne we\nMaximus \u00fea cw\u00e6\u00f0 to \u00feam martyrum \u00feus, Fyr me forb\u00e6rne gif ic ne buge to Criste, si\u00fe\u00fean ic geseo hu\n\u00dea cw\u00e6don \u00fea halgan gebro\u00fera \u00fee he on bendum l\u00e6dde, Bebeod \u00feysum cwellerum \u00fe\u00e6t hi us cuce\nHi wurdon \u00fea gebrohte on bendum to his huse, and Cecilia seo eadige mid arwur\u00f0um sacerdum \u00feider\nHw\u00e6t \u00fea on d\u00e6gr\u00e6d \u00fe\u00e6t deorwur\u00f0e m\u00e6den Cecilia clypode, and cw\u00e6\u00f0 to him eallum, Nu ge la Godes\nGe habba\u00f0 gecampod swi\u00f0e godne campdom, eowerne ryne ge gefyldon and geleafan geheoldon.\nGa\u00f0 to \u00feam wuldorbeage \u00fe\u00e6s wynsuman lifes, \u00feonne se rihtwisa dema de\u00f0 eow to edleane.\nHi wurdon \u00fea gel\u00e6dde for heora geleafan to slege, and mid swurde beheafdode.\n\u00dea beheold Maximus and s\u00e6de mid a\u00fee to \u00feam ymbstandendum, Ic geseah so\u00f0lice mid \u00feam \u00fee hi\n\u00dea \u00fea Maximus s\u00e6de swa so\u00f0lice \u00f0as word weopendum eagum, \u00fee gewendon \u00fea h\u00e6\u00feenan manega to\nAlmachius \u00fea ofaxode \u00fe\u00e6t se arwur\u00f0a Maximus mid eallum his hiwum on \u00feone H\u00e6lend gelyfde, and\nCecilia \u00fea sona \u00feone sanct bebyrigde on st\u00e6nenre \u00feryh on \u00feam stede \u00fee lagon \u00fea twegen gebro\u00fera\nHeo d\u00e6lde \u00fea si\u00f0\u00f0an digellice \u00feearfum hire brydguman \u00e6hta, and his bro\u00feor \u00feing; and Almachius\n\u00dea weopon \u00fea h\u00e6\u00f0enan \u00fe\u00e6t swa wlitig f\u00e6mne, and swa \u00e6\u00feelboren wimman mid wisdome afylled,\n\u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 Cecilia and s\u00e6de him eallum, Ne bi\u00f0 se forloren \u00fee li\u00f0 for Gode ofslagen; he bi\u00f0 swa awend\nHeo tihte \u00fea swa lange \u00fea ungeleaffullan h\u00e6\u00f0enan o\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t hi ealle cw\u00e6don mid anre stemne \u00feus, We\n\u00dea wurdon gefullode feower hund manna on Cecilian huse \u00feam H\u00e6lende to lofe, and se papa m\u00e6ssode\nAlmachius se arleasa het \u00fea ardlice gefeccan \u00fea eadigan Cecilian, and hi axode sona of hwylcere\nAnd \u00fe\u00e6t m\u00e6den him cw\u00e6\u00f0 to, Ic secge, gif \u00feu h\u00e6tst, hwilce mihte \u00feu h\u00e6fst.\n\u00c6lces mannes miht \u00fee on modignysse f\u00e6r\u00f0 is so\u00f0lice \u00feam gelic swilce man siwige ane bytte, and\nAlmachius hire cw\u00e6\u00f0 to \u00fea \u00fea hi campodon mid wordum, Hw\u00e6t \u00feu unges\u00e6lige, nast \u00feu \u00fe\u00e6t me is\n\u00de\u00e6t m\u00e6den him cw\u00e6\u00f0 to, O\u00feer is modignyss, o\u00feer is anr\u00e6dnyss, and ic anr\u00e6dlice spr\u00e6c, na modelice,\nAnd eft heo cw\u00e6\u00f0 him to, \u00feu cw\u00e6de \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu h\u00e6fdest to acwellene anweald and to edcucigenne, ac ic\nAlmachius hire andwyrde, Awurp \u00feine dyrstignysse and geoffra \u00feam godum arwur\u00f0lice\nCecilia him cw\u00e6\u00f0 to, cunna mid grapunge hw\u00e6\u00f0er hi stanas synd, and st\u00e6nene anlicnysse, \u00fea \u00fee \u00feu\nHi mihton wel to lime gif man hi lede on ad; nu hi ne fremia\u00f0 him sylfum, ne so\u00f0lice mannum; and hi\n\u00dea wear\u00f0 se arleasa dema deoflice gram, and het hi l\u00e6dan sona, and seo\u00f0an on w\u00e6tere on hire agenum\n\u00dea dydon \u00fea h\u00e6\u00feenan swa swa hi het Almachius, and heo l\u00e6g on \u00feam b\u00e6\u00f0e bufan byrnendum fyre,\nHi cyddon \u00fea Almachie hu \u00fe\u00e6t m\u00e6den \u00feurhwunode on \u00feam hatum ba\u00f0e mid halum lichaman, and\n\u00dea sende he \u00e6nne cwellere to, and het hi beheafdian on \u00feam hatan w\u00e6tere.\nSe cwellere hi sloh \u00fea mid his swurde \u00e6ne, eft, and \u00feryddan si\u00f0e, ac hire swura n\u00e6s forod; and he\nHeo leofode \u00fea \u00fery dagas and \u00fea geleaffullan tihte, and hire m\u00e6dena bet\u00e6hte \u00feam maran papan, and\nAnd Urbanus se papa bebyrigde hi arwur\u00f0lice to wuldre \u00feam \u00e6lmihtigan \u00fee on ecnysse rixa\u00f0; AMEN.",
